# <type>(<scope>)<!>: <subject>
#   At most 72 characters. Imperative, lower case first word, no full stop.
#   No (#123) in the subject: issues go in the trailers.
#
# <body: why, not what. Optional for a one-line change.>
#
# <trailers, the last paragraph>
# Refs: #164
# Co-Authored-By: Claude <model> <noreply@anthropic.com>
#
# Types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scope: optional, a lowercase area (review-loop).
# Breaking change: `!` after the scope and a `BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks,
#        how to migrate>` trailer.
# Standard: https://www.conventionalcommits.org
